## Playback fix - update FI TUNE

We fixed a playback problem that could cause the app to show **"No stream available"** when YouTube rejected an audio stream.

The app now retries a failed stream with a different supported playback client, limits recovery attempts to avoid repeated retry loops, and lets the app's recovery process handle known HTTP 403 stream failures.

**Update to FI TUNE 1.0.4 to get this fix.** Download the latest version from the [FI TUNE GitHub release](https://github.com/ignite-1018/FI-TUNE/releases/tag/V1.0.4).

Stream availability can still vary by track or network. If playback continues to fail after updating, let us know which track is affected.
